      <p class="sc-cta-text">SDF Clothing produces garments with pre-tested shrinkage values and full compliance documentation for EU, USA, UK, and Australian buyers. MOQ from 300 pieces.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="sc-cta-btn">Get a Production Quote</a>
